Z||000004||ThatRickGuy||10-18-2000||09:29 PM||||I looked again today, and I'm not sure which one of the 2 it is, but 1 of them is the exact length/position to go into a vacuum connection in the bottom of the TB. the other one can be bent to go there but doesn't feel like that's it's natural home. but it's gotta go right in that same area.... nearg. on a brighter note, I got the engine to turn over and I have oil preasure  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> took a new battery and starter but hey, it's there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
